    omega_nominal        121.4749 rad/s   (1160 rpm)
    V_flow_nominal       0.074690 m3/s   (168 kg/s at 2249.3 kg/m3)
    P_hydraulic           22.4070 kW     (dp_nominal * V_flow_nominal)
    tau_hyd_nominal      230.5720 N.m    (that power / (omega_n * eta_is))
    tau_shaft              4.0000 s      <-- FITTED effective parameter, not a measured inertia
    J                      7.5924 kg.m2  (follows from tau_shaft; NOT independent of it)

Note on J.  J and tau_shaft are one degree of freedom written two ways, and the model exposes
both. Only one may ever be set. No measured MSRE fuel-pump moment of inertia is in hand, so J is
a *derived* consequence of a fitted time constant and must not be reported as a rotor property.

